      <dia:attribute name="text">
        <dia:composite type="text">
          <dia:attribute name="string">
            <dia:string>#TokenStore - the directory MCP_AUTH_TOKENS: a file per client,
the name - the name of the client, the content - the SHA-256
of its token ("sha256:&lt;64 hex&gt;"); read again once per
MCP_AUTH_RELOAD_PERIOD (5 s), or "once" - load() in
server_kwargs(), as root, before the privileges drop.
